## Executive Summary

This project analyzes whether franchise leadership stability — measured through head coach tenure and starting quarterback tenure — correlates with team success in the NFL.

Using data from 2016–2025, a **Franchise Stability Index** was created and compared with team win totals.

The analysis suggests that teams with longer-tenured leadership often exhibit more consistent performance.
